Z||000000||Hank is Here||10-19-2001||05:53 PM||||The other week I tore the seat in my 87 GT.  I pulled it out and am having the cover rebuilt.  In the mean time I threw in an 84 SE seat in my 87 as a temporary replacemnt, it is ripped but is still a place to sit.  Darned if I don't like the seat.  It looks good with the center stripe thing gonig down the middle.  The best part of the whole darn seat is the net attached to the back of it.   <BR>Since I am thinking about Mr. Mikes next year anyone know if he can add these nets to the backs?  Also does he have any similiar style to the 84 SE with the striped down the middle?    ||||reg||1
